  "_regionNote": "THE ONE-PLACE RULE (SHA, 2026-09-12): a session step has ONE place. The card names it, the body map marks it, and the only picture shown is a picture of that place. regionToSite maps a body-map region to the site that IS that place. A region absent from this map has no site, and a step there shows NO photograph — never a neighbouring one. See regionUnmapped for why each omission is deliberate.",
